  "reasoning": "The defendant organized a private mutual aid scheme and attracted members to contribute money, amounting to over 9 million yuan, without any legal authorization. This constitutes illegal absorption of public deposits, which is punishable under the Criminal Law of the People’s Republic of China as the crime of illegal fundraising/illegal absorption of public deposits. No other criminal conduct such as fraud or embezzlement is indicated, so only this charge applies.",
